  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The islandora software creates objects, and stores them",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "in our fedora-commons installation, using the REST-API.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Every object has a datastream \"TN\", which is jpeg-file,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "that serves as a \"thumbnail\". This datastream is versionable.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Mostly, all goes fine. But sometimes, the new version is registered",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "by fedora, but strangely disappears from the underlying filesystem,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "without fedora noting this in the datastream description.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "All I could was this in the log files:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "[..]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.035 [http-8080-16] (DatastreamResource) addOrUpdate",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.035 [http-8080-16] (DefaultManagement) Completed getDatastream(pid: islandora:20401, datastreamID: TN, asOfDateTime: null)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.045 [http-8080-50] (DatastreamResource) addOrUpdate",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.046 [http-8080-50] (DefaultManagement) Completed getDatastream(pid: islandora:20401, datastreamID: TN, asOfDateTime: null)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.049 [http-8080-16] (DefaultDOManager) Committing modification of islandora:20401",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.049 [http-8080-16] (DefaultDOManager) Getting managed datastream from internal uploaded location: uploaded://133842 for islandora:20401",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.066 [http-8080-16] (DefaultDOManager) Replaced managed datastream location with internal id: islandora:20401+TN+TN.0",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.067 [http-8080-16] (DefaultDOManager) Adding to ResourceIndex",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.075 [http-8080-16] (DefaultDOManager) Updating dissemination index for islandora:20401",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.075 [http-8080-16] (DefaultDOManager) Updating FieldSearch index",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.077 [http-8080-16] (DefaultManagement) Completed addDatastream(pid: islandora:20401, dsID: TN, altIDs: , dsLabel: Thumbnail, versionable: true, MIMEType: image/jpeg, formatURI: , dsLocation: uploaded://133842, controlGroup: M, dsState: A, checksumType: DISABLED, checksum: null, logMessage: Copied datastream from islandora:20401.)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.081 [http-8080-16] (DefaultManagement) Completed getDatastream(pid: islandora:20401, datastreamID: TN, asOfDateTime: null)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.083 [http-8080-50] (DefaultDOManager) Committing modification of islandora:20401",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.084 [http-8080-50] (DefaultDOManager) Getting managed datastream from internal uploaded location: uploaded://133843 for islandora:20401",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.098 [http-8080-50] (DefaultDOManager) Replaced managed datastream location with internal id: islandora:20401+TN+TN.0",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.098 [http-8080-50] (DefaultDOManager) Removed purged datastream version from low level storage (token = islandora:20401+TN+TN.0)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.100 [http-8080-50] (DefaultDOManager) Adding to ResourceIndex",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.118 [http-8080-50] (DefaultDOManager) Updating dissemination index for islandora:20401",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.118 [http-8080-50] (DefaultDOManager) Updating FieldSearch index",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.120 [http-8080-50] (DefaultManagement) Completed addDatastream(pid: islandora:20401, dsID: TN, altIDs: , dsLabel: Thumbnail, versionable: true, MIMEType: image/jpeg, formatURI: , dsLocation: uploaded://133843, controlGroup: M, dsState: A, checksumType: DISABLED, checksum: null, logMessage: Copied datastream from islandora:20401.)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "INFO 2015-10-22 10:59:58.131 [http-8080-50] (DefaultManagement) Completed getDatastream(pid: islandora:20401, datastreamID: TN, asOfDateTime: null)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "[..]",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As you can see, the file is uploaded two times. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "The first file \"uploaded://133842\" gets the identifier \"islandora:20401+TN+TN.0\".",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "The second file \"uploaded://133843\" also gets the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "identifier \"islandora:20401+TN+TN.0\".",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This double identifier probably causes the deletion of the underlying file,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "as reported in the log:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Removed purged datastream version from low level storage (token = islandora:20401+TN+TN.0)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The method \"deletePurgedDatastreams\" in DefaultDOManager",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "does this?",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Is this behaviour intented? What can I do to prevent this?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Thanks in advance",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
