     "body": "<p>Update: islandora updates the datastream TN using two concurrent processes.</p>\n\n<p>And indeed, if you use two concurrent threads, this problem occurs.</p>\n\n<p>Can this be prevented, or is this fixed in another version of Fedora?</p>\n\n<p>cf. <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1284\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1284</a></p>",
     "created": "19/Nov/15 8:17 AM",
